  "name": "HIIT Circuit Card — three athletes, four stations, four rounds",
  "description": "Three athletes, four stations (rower, kettlebell, box step-overs, sled push), four rounds of 60s all-out work then 60s rest on the floor — no rest after round 4, which runs straight into a group cooldown. One station sits empty each round; the single-instance equipment (maxConcurrent 1) is what enforces 'nobody starts until the athlete ahead has left it'. 5-minute floor warm-up starts and finishes together; 10-minute cooldown starts only when all three have cleared the fourth station.",
